  "title": "Houston American Energy Corp. Announces $8.0 Million Registered Direct Offering",
  "summary": "HOUSTON, TX, Nov. 20, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Houston American Energy Corp. (NYSE American: HUSA) (“HUSA” or the “Company”) and its wholly owned subsidiary, Abundia Global Impact Group, LLC (“AGIG”), today announced that it has entered into securities purchase agreements with existing and new fundamental institutional investors for the purchase and sale of 2,285,715 shares […]",
